Bump PyO3 0.26.0 -> 0.29.3 so the extension can be built for Python 3.15.

PyO3 0.26 caps CPython support at 3.14 and aborts the pyo3-ffi build script
for newer interpreters; 0.29.0 is the first release supporting 3.15. No
source changes are needed (upstream CI passes with 0.29.0 on 3.10-3.14).

Upstream: https://github.com/pydicom/pylibjpeg-rle/pull/60
Drop this patch once a release including a PyO3 >=0.29 bump is available.

